  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"411\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_Ultimate.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"84\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">這個模組讓你能夠透過設定檔來創建自訂的天空島嶼。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">你只需使用原版 Minecraft 的結構方塊，或是結構保存器物品來創建一個結構檔案，並設定島嶼可能的生成點。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">這個模組需要在伺服器和客戶端同時安裝。在客戶端創建新世界時，它會在「更多世界選項...」設定中新增一個「天空島嶼」世界類型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">對於伺服器，請在 server.properties 或 forge-common.toml（設定檔）中使用 \"skyblockbuilder:custom_skyblock\"（1.18+ 版本使用 \"skyblockbuilder:skyblock\"）作為世界類型。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">這個模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libx\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibX</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">協助翻譯模組 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foss5m9q.oneskyapp.com%252fadmin%252fproject%252fdashboard%252fproject%252f177200\" rel=\"nofollow\">請至 One Sky</a>。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_Overview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"84\"></p><p><em>有點低調且是德語的，但或許有幫助</em></p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vcxpt3WnxvM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Skyblock_Builder/BH_SB_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"169\"></span></a><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">#廣告 #Ad</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
